/// The InfluxDB rule action converts the message payload into InfluxDB line
/// protocol. It writes the result to a table in an InfluxDB database. The
/// database can be an Amazon Timestream for InfluxDB instance or a
/// self-managed InfluxDB cluster. The action connects to InfluxDB through
/// an InfluxDB topic rule destination, which must be in the ENABLED state
/// before the action can write data.
